  9+++669F              ;
 10+++669F              ; ALLOC returns a page-aligned contiguous physical extent. The caller sees
 11+++669F              ; a 32-bit byte offset; page numbers and the 16 KiB mapping window are private.
 12+++669F              ; READ/WRITE/STREAM operations will use the same mapper and split internally.
 13+++669F              ;
 14+++669F              ; Reserved pages are based on the Project112 ATM2+ memory map and the P127
 15+++669F              ; boot runtime: page 0 system/BASIC map, page 2 host stack, page 5 host image,
